WEBVTT

00:00.470 --> 00:04.810
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

00:04.810 --> 00:12.530
Asano hitogomi o nagamete coffee nondeiru
Watching a crowd in the morning, and drinking coffee

00:13.450 --> 00:21.450
Aseri nado naikano youni hitoni wa mieru daro
People must see me as if I don't have any worries

00:22.080 --> 00:29.920
lma menomae ni atomodori dekinai jikan ga
I know that the time I will never be able to get back

00:30.710 --> 00:38.220
Tashika ni nagareteru koto o watashi wa shitteru
Is moving in front of me

00:38.430 --> 00:47.440
Marude kyou shika nai toiu ikikata o shitemita toki
If I live like today is the last day of my life

00:47.730 --> 00:55.490
Saisho ni nani ga mieru darou
I wonder what I can see first

00:56.570 --> 01:00.830
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

01:01.240 --> 01:09.250
Sore ga donnani chiisana hikari demo ii
I don't care no matter how small the light is

01:09.750 --> 01:11.750
Sugata o misete hoshii
I just wish to see its shape

01:11.750 --> 01:15.970
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

01:16.680 --> 01:22.430
lma no kimochi sonomama hanaseru
I want to meet someone

01:22.430 --> 01:22.680
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest
lma no kimochi sonomama hanaseru
I want to meet someone

01:22.680 --> 01:29.150
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest
Sonna hito ni deaitai
Who I can tell my honest feelings to

01:29.150 --> 01:30.980
Mermaid Forest
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology

01:41.030 --> 01:44.690
Yuta! The fire's going!
Did you get any fish yet?

01:45.000 --> 01:45.970
There!

01:47.970 --> 01:48.800
No luck.

01:49.370 --> 01:50.960
I can't do it this way.

01:51.140 --> 01:55.470
You have to use your hands.
The fisherman's instinct.

01:59.280 --> 02:01.940
Got it!
Mana, here, eat it!

02:03.690 --> 02:07.450
Just one?
How discouraging.

02:11.290 --> 02:12.490
<i>Natsume...</i>

02:21.030 --> 02:25.540
Episode 7
Bone Princess

02:26.780 --> 02:30.180
They say the Tokugawas
have come to power.

02:30.480 --> 02:33.240
What's going to happen
to Lord Toyotomi?

02:33.420 --> 02:34.380
Don't know.

02:34.650 --> 02:38.680
Now, everyone, have you heard of
a creature called a "mermaid"?

02:39.050 --> 02:40.960
Her looks are that of
a celestial maiden.

02:40.960 --> 02:42.930
Her voice is like that of a lark...

02:42.930 --> 02:46.920
and her flesh is the elixir of
eternal youth and immortality.

02:47.100 --> 02:50.390
Have a good look at the precious
mermaid I have right here.

02:50.500 --> 02:52.130
You'll live longer.

02:54.000 --> 02:54.800
It's real!

02:54.970 --> 02:55.700
It's real!

02:59.210 --> 03:02.780
Now, this girl here ate mermaid
flesh when she was 12 and...

03:02.780 --> 03:06.080
obtained eternal youth
and immortality.

03:13.490 --> 03:16.690
No worries.
Here, look.

03:19.600 --> 03:20.990
It's healed!

03:21.260 --> 03:22.390
How is that possible?

03:22.560 --> 03:25.260
This is also the effect
of mermaid flesh.

03:25.700 --> 03:28.070
Eat this precious flesh,
and you'll have eternal youth...

03:28.070 --> 03:30.900
and immortality,
as well as perfect state of health.

03:31.170 --> 03:31.840
I'll buy it!

03:31.840 --> 03:32.830
I'll buy one, too!

03:33.180 --> 03:35.910
Yes, yes, thank you so much.

03:35.980 --> 03:37.310
Give me some, too!

03:37.410 --> 03:38.610
Me, too!

03:41.420 --> 03:43.780
There's no doubt about it.
That girl...

03:45.250 --> 03:47.310
You bought mermaid flesh?

03:47.590 --> 03:49.850
Yeah, at an exhibit-booth
at the market.

03:50.190 --> 03:52.490
Have you already eaten it?

03:52.830 --> 03:56.130
Yeah, but I don't know.
It tasted like carp.

03:56.830 --> 03:58.070
Look at this.

03:58.070 --> 03:59.900
I sped across a mountain path a bit...

03:59.900 --> 04:02.170
and I haven't healed
from my scratches at all.

04:02.240 --> 04:04.230
Maybe it was carp after all.

04:05.610 --> 04:06.900
Good for you.

04:15.720 --> 04:19.210
Oops, I should leave the
rest for the mermaid.

04:20.790 --> 04:22.280
Evil spirit.

04:27.100 --> 04:28.360
Be gone to the other world!

04:33.300 --> 04:34.860
<i>I'm hungry.</i>

04:48.020 --> 04:48.980
Stop it!

04:54.790 --> 04:55.220
Bastard!

04:57.530 --> 04:58.520
Bastard!

05:00.760 --> 05:02.260
-Bastard!
-Oh, hey! Don't move too much...

05:02.260 --> 05:05.030
or you'll lose all the
blood from your body.

05:05.730 --> 05:07.100
But...but...

05:09.670 --> 05:11.330
Natsume!

05:11.670 --> 05:12.800
Natsume!

05:16.010 --> 05:17.170
Pa!

05:18.180 --> 05:20.510
A very old "Pa" you've got there.

05:22.820 --> 05:26.150
It's a secret, OK?
I don't think he's my real Pa.

05:28.160 --> 05:32.530
Poor child.
Here, Natsume, let your Pa see it.

05:33.700 --> 05:36.260
Did you say a monk did this to you?

05:38.630 --> 05:41.300
He said, "Be gone to the other world".
What does it mean?

05:41.770 --> 05:43.260
I don't know.

05:44.010 --> 05:46.840
Are you the man who's
peddling mermaid flesh?

05:47.180 --> 05:49.080
I heard stories about you, old man.

05:49.480 --> 05:52.140
That's right.
Did you say your name is Yuta?

05:52.650 --> 05:55.140
I'll give you a piece
as a token of thanks.

05:55.320 --> 05:57.620
No thanks. How can you operate
such a shady business?

05:58.990 --> 06:01.860
Well, I for one consider it
selling the dream of...

06:01.860 --> 06:04.220
eternal youth and immortality.

06:04.830 --> 06:07.120
Living forever doesn't equal good!

06:07.360 --> 06:08.890
You think so?

06:09.930 --> 06:13.230
Natsume, you're all right now.
Can you move it?

06:14.300 --> 06:16.460
Wow!
It's good as new!

06:18.870 --> 06:23.110
Hey, she ate real
mermaid flesh, didn't she?

06:23.850 --> 06:26.940
That's what I say for my show.

06:28.820 --> 06:29.370
Look.

06:31.990 --> 06:33.550
The wound is gone!

06:33.720 --> 06:36.120
Wow, just like me!

06:36.360 --> 06:40.800
I ate mermaid flesh.
I've already lived for 120 years.

06:41.360 --> 06:43.920
As you just saw,
any wound heals instantly.

06:44.570 --> 06:47.090
I've died many times,
but I've come back to life every time.

06:47.700 --> 06:49.600
I want my normal body back.

06:50.070 --> 06:52.840
And I heard I have to find
a mermaid for that.

06:53.180 --> 06:56.440
Is that it? We have a
mermaid right here.

07:00.920 --> 07:02.440
What is that?

07:02.750 --> 07:04.620
That's what we use for the show.

07:04.850 --> 07:07.250
I suppose it's not the mermaid
you're looking for.

07:07.660 --> 07:09.560
But...but you're...

07:11.030 --> 07:15.690
I'm afraid this girl isn't one of those
who ate mermaid flesh.

07:17.630 --> 07:21.190
It's late.
We can talk tomorrow.

07:22.040 --> 07:25.800
It's not the nicest place, but at least
there's a roof over your head.

07:26.210 --> 07:27.730
Stay here for the night.

07:32.180 --> 07:33.810
<i>What's going on?</i>

07:34.720 --> 07:39.920
<i>This girl, Natsume. If she didn't eat</i>
<i>mermaid flesh, how does she...?</i>

07:49.900 --> 07:50.920
What are you doing?!

07:51.900 --> 07:56.630
Natsume! I'm so sorry.
Please leave, please go now!

08:03.210 --> 08:05.940
Ouch!
She bit me with all her might.

08:09.850 --> 08:13.340
She tried to take and
eat your liver, didn't she?

08:13.920 --> 08:15.480
You're that monk from earlier.

08:17.190 --> 08:20.090
Who's that old man and girl?

08:21.030 --> 08:24.020
And that creature that looks
like a monkey and a mermaid.

08:24.730 --> 08:27.000
I don't have the faintest
idea what's going on.

08:27.000 --> 08:29.990
That girl is not of this world.

08:32.640 --> 08:37.040
I created her with my own hands
long ago, by collecting her bones.

08:37.810 --> 08:38.740
Bones?

08:39.410 --> 08:42.180
Using a secret art called
"Calling Back of the Spirit."

08:44.050 --> 08:45.680
It was a few decades ago...

08:45.790 --> 08:48.950
when the world was in
total chaos because of the war.

08:49.620 --> 08:52.990
I was making my rounds to
nearby villages to pray for the dead.

08:53.700 --> 08:58.270
That's when I met him. He was
holding the skull of a young child.

08:58.270 --> 09:00.940
I was moved to pity
by the sight of him.

09:00.940 --> 09:02.400
So I invited him to my temple, and...

09:03.570 --> 09:05.410
<i>The secret art of</i>
<i>calling back of the spirit.</i>

09:05.410 --> 09:08.900
<i>Because of my inexperience,</i>
<i>I can't guarantee that it will succeed.</i>

09:09.480 --> 09:11.950
<i>However, if I use the mermaid liver...</i>

09:11.950 --> 09:14.920
<i>that's been handed down</i>
<i>through my temple, then perhaps...</i>

09:15.720 --> 09:17.150
Mermaid liver?

09:17.920 --> 09:19.920
By applying arsenic
anhydride to the bones...

09:19.920 --> 09:21.690
crushing the leaves of
strawberry and chickweed...

09:21.690 --> 09:23.490
and burning
agalloch and olibanum...

09:23.490 --> 09:26.430
I was able to bring back the
young girl to life from her bones.

09:27.060 --> 09:28.260
However...

09:28.900 --> 09:31.030
she began capturing dogs and cats,
and later attacking humans.

09:31.030 --> 09:33.940
Anyone injured in the war, she'd take
the livers out of their living bodies...

09:33.940 --> 09:35.700
and consume them.

09:36.140 --> 09:38.130
Just as we consume food.

09:39.670 --> 09:43.840
By the time I decided to turn
the girl back into bones...

09:44.210 --> 09:47.580
the man had already
gone off with her.

09:48.420 --> 09:50.520
He must have learned
how to perform...

09:50.520 --> 09:52.920
the secret art of calling back
of the spirit, by watching me.

09:52.920 --> 09:54.920
Then he created the mermaid
that he uses for his show...

09:54.920 --> 09:56.410
from the bones
of a monkey and a fish.

09:58.290 --> 10:01.200
During my travels, in search of him,
I have seen and heard of...

10:01.200 --> 10:03.760
many who were suddenly
turned back into bones.

10:05.300 --> 10:07.440
Are you saying that the old man was
performing a improper version of...

10:07.440 --> 10:09.430
the calling back of the spirit,
or whatever it is?

10:09.770 --> 10:14.070
I wonder if the reason only why Natsume
hasn't reverted back to bones...

10:14.580 --> 10:17.440
after so many decades,
is because I used a mermaid liver.

10:20.050 --> 10:23.690
Now, this girl here ate
mermaid flesh when she was 12...

10:23.690 --> 10:26.920
and obtained eternal youth
and immortality.

10:27.820 --> 10:29.920
<i>She doesn't look like</i>
<i>an evil spirit to me.</i>

10:31.490 --> 10:32.480
Yuta!

10:33.330 --> 10:36.490
Sorry about last night.
Did it hurt?

10:37.030 --> 10:40.000
Were you going to eat my liver?

10:41.200 --> 10:44.240
I wanted to know what a
precious liver taken from a body...

10:44.240 --> 10:46.570
that has eternal youth and
immortality would taste like.

10:48.480 --> 10:49.530
Natsume!

10:50.180 --> 10:52.740
Oops, I forgot.
I was working.

10:53.520 --> 10:55.040
See you later.

10:56.250 --> 10:59.740
<i>That girl should not have been</i>
<i>released into the world.</i>

11:00.090 --> 11:02.020
<i>She must be returned to bones.</i>

11:02.520 --> 11:07.060
<i>I am going on a fast to purify my body</i>
<i>in order to heighten my dharmic power.</i>

11:07.060 --> 11:09.600
<i>I will not be able to take any action</i>
<i>for the next seven days.</i>

11:09.600 --> 11:11.500
<i>So, I'd like to ask you a favor.</i>

11:11.900 --> 11:14.460
<i>Take part in getting</i>
<i>rid of your monster?</i>

11:14.840 --> 11:17.300
<i>The only thing you have to do</i>
<i>is keep an eye on her.</i>

11:17.540 --> 11:20.540
<i>She'll be better off moving on to the</i>
<i>next world than continuing to exist...</i>

11:20.540 --> 11:23.670
<i>in this world in such</i>
<i>a shameful state.</i>

11:24.880 --> 11:26.570
So he says, but...

11:26.980 --> 11:28.570
Yuta!

11:30.090 --> 11:32.180
Don't you have to help
with the show?

11:32.750 --> 11:37.490
Pa's gone out. Hey, is it really true
that you won't get old?

11:38.130 --> 11:39.820
You won't be able to grow up?

11:40.230 --> 11:42.460
Silly, I'm already a grownup.

11:43.830 --> 11:45.800
What about your Pa and Ma?

11:46.030 --> 11:48.300
They've gone to the great
beyond a long time ago.

11:48.840 --> 11:50.630
Then you're all alone, aren't you?

11:50.710 --> 11:51.300
I guess.

11:52.010 --> 11:55.700
Poor thing.
You want me to come with you?

11:56.280 --> 12:00.370
You're so cold-hearted.
What about your Pa?

12:02.150 --> 12:05.350
I wonder if he's really my Pa.
It's strange.

12:06.390 --> 12:10.380
I don't remember anything before
I woke up. Not even about Pa.

12:11.560 --> 12:15.520
Only he gets old.
And I stay the way I am.

12:19.920 --> 12:29.970
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest

12:30.410 --> 12:32.680
As you instructed, I left the body
of my daughter, the princess...

12:32.680 --> 12:35.050
in the yard until only
the bones were left.

12:35.450 --> 12:36.850
That's how you wanted it,
was it not?

12:37.220 --> 12:41.280
Yes. I promise you that
I will bring the princess back to life.

12:41.720 --> 12:43.920
But how?

12:44.730 --> 12:47.960
I have experience with the secret art
of "Calling Back of the Spirit."

12:48.800 --> 12:51.670
The mountain is
where spirits gather.

12:51.670 --> 12:55.330
This time, I will create a
good child who will live long.

12:56.840 --> 12:58.200
That was heavy.

12:58.310 --> 13:00.930
Was it hard?
Ah, sorry about that.

13:01.680 --> 13:03.110
Say, Pa...

13:04.380 --> 13:06.570
Is this how I was born too?

13:08.750 --> 13:10.620
Why are you doing this?

13:11.150 --> 13:16.650
I'm creating a life.
I'm doing a good thing.

13:17.230 --> 13:23.030
No matter in what form, the best thing
you can do is to be alive, Natsume.

13:36.140 --> 13:40.410
Mermaid, look,
I brought you a liver.

13:45.890 --> 13:48.860
Pa, you'll make another
mermaid, won't you?

13:49.320 --> 13:53.350
After I'm done creating the princess.
We'll close the show until then.

13:56.300 --> 13:59.060
Now you can rest.
You must be tired.

14:00.170 --> 14:04.970
Oh, so your mermaid is dead.
Well, don't be sad.

14:05.340 --> 14:08.780
I'm not!
So, what are you doing?

14:09.210 --> 14:13.910
I have to work once in a while, too.
Here, you want some fish liver?

14:18.890 --> 14:20.910
How discouraging.

14:23.160 --> 14:27.460
If I could at least grow up,
I'd be able to live on my own...

14:27.930 --> 14:29.990
even when my Pa's gone.

14:30.200 --> 14:31.930
You sure?

14:32.230 --> 14:33.170
Damn.

14:34.070 --> 14:38.160
<i>She'll be better off moving on to the</i>
<i>next world than continuing to exist...</i>

14:38.270 --> 14:41.610
<i>in this world in such a shameful state,</i>
<i>eating the livers of living creatures.</i>

14:41.980 --> 14:44.240
<i>But she's alive, isn't she?</i>

14:44.780 --> 14:47.040
<i>She's thinking about</i>
<i>going on living, isn't she?</i>

14:49.320 --> 14:51.510
Natsume, do you want to come along?

14:54.190 --> 14:56.490
Do you want to come with me?

15:01.500 --> 15:02.550
When?

15:04.400 --> 15:05.700
The sooner the better.

15:06.530 --> 15:08.770
<i>I will heighten my dharmic power</i>
<i>for seven days...</i>

15:08.770 --> 15:10.670
<i>and then return Natsume</i>
<i>back to bones.</i>

15:11.270 --> 15:14.500
<i>Today is the seventh day. We have to</i>
<i>get you out of this place quickly.</i>

15:15.040 --> 15:17.570
Wait here.
I'll bring Pa here.

15:17.980 --> 15:19.970
I want you to say
goodbye to him too.

15:22.220 --> 15:23.440
<i>Natsume...</i>

15:30.330 --> 15:31.090
Yuta...

15:32.760 --> 15:35.520
Natsume told me everything.

15:42.600 --> 15:44.940
Are you sure she's waiting
so deep in the mountain?

15:45.440 --> 15:46.530
Yes.

15:50.710 --> 15:53.200
Natsume!
Natsume!

15:58.520 --> 15:59.990
What the?!

16:00.790 --> 16:05.690
Don't take Natsume away from me.
She's my only daughter.

16:09.200 --> 16:10.860
I won't let anyone take her.

16:15.570 --> 16:19.870
Strange. Pa's not here.
What should I do?

16:20.610 --> 16:23.770
It'd be cold of me to leave
without telling him good-bye.

16:24.350 --> 16:27.340
I know, he's making the
princess on the mountain!

16:34.120 --> 16:37.290
Natsume, move on
to the next world.

16:48.740 --> 16:50.730
You!
What are you?

16:50.810 --> 16:52.530
You've awakened.

16:52.610 --> 16:56.410
She is a poor princess who died
when she was very young.

16:57.010 --> 16:59.100
What are you going to do with me?

16:59.280 --> 17:01.750
I've decided to take the liver
from your body, gifted with...

17:01.750 --> 17:03.580
eternal youth and immortality.

17:04.590 --> 17:08.820
Natsume is still alive because
a mermaid liver was used.

17:09.120 --> 17:12.920
Then your liver might work as well.

17:14.400 --> 17:15.050
You...

17:17.600 --> 17:20.230
That mermaid liver I used in you...

17:20.230 --> 17:23.600
When I performed the art of
calling back of the spirit.

17:23.600 --> 17:25.870
I shall remove it,
and you will be destroyed!

17:30.380 --> 17:34.340
<i>Natsume, do you want to come along?</i>
<i>Do you want to come with me?</i>

17:34.950 --> 17:37.920
<i>I do! I do, Yuta!</i>

17:46.130 --> 17:47.390
Serves you right!

17:53.770 --> 17:55.290
Stop struggling.

17:55.970 --> 17:59.140
You said you've already
lived a very long life.

17:59.140 --> 18:01.230
Besides, there's nobody
who'll cry, even if you die.

18:01.440 --> 18:05.070
You shouldn't create
any more children like Natsume!

18:05.350 --> 18:08.280
You can never understand
how a parent feels...

18:08.280 --> 18:10.880
whose child was taken away!

18:15.860 --> 18:17.020
Pa?

18:18.490 --> 18:20.360
Pa, what are you doing?

18:21.130 --> 18:22.100
Stop it!

18:22.300 --> 18:25.860
Step back, Natsume.
I'm taking the liver out of his body.

18:26.300 --> 18:27.820
If you do that, Yuta will die!

18:28.370 --> 18:31.740
I'm going to give the
princess eternal life.

18:32.170 --> 18:33.300
Just like yours.

18:36.040 --> 18:38.380
Stop it, stop it, Pa!

18:40.850 --> 18:41.710
Pa!

18:42.220 --> 18:45.010
Oh, she's already solidifying.

18:47.190 --> 18:49.350
I have to transfer the liver quickly.

18:51.390 --> 18:52.290
Natsume.

18:55.760 --> 18:59.220
Natsume, what have you done?

18:59.970 --> 19:01.400
Don't wake her up.

19:02.200 --> 19:04.930
I feel sorry for her!
You can't wake her up!

19:07.810 --> 19:08.470
Natsume...

19:09.280 --> 19:15.240
I'm sorry, Pa.
I really wanted to go with Yuta.

19:16.620 --> 19:19.880
I'm like Yuta!
We're of the same kind!

19:24.690 --> 19:28.560
Natsume, what's happened to you?
You're bleeding from your belly.

19:31.270 --> 19:34.760
It's OK.
You're Pa is here for you.

19:35.140 --> 19:36.100
Pa?

19:42.410 --> 19:44.140
<i>That old fool.</i>
<i>Is he...?!</i>

19:46.310 --> 19:50.050
Pa? What's wrong?
You're acting weird.

19:50.820 --> 19:54.350
I'll come with you.
You won't be lonely.

19:54.920 --> 19:55.720
Pa...

19:57.290 --> 19:58.050
Don't!

20:00.730 --> 20:01.850
Natsume!

20:02.100 --> 20:03.060
Yuta!

20:03.060 --> 20:04.830
Natsume!

20:07.400 --> 20:08.060
Pa...

20:12.370 --> 20:13.900
<i>All right.</i>

20:23.920 --> 20:25.720
Natsume.
Natsume!

20:29.520 --> 20:30.630
Natsume.

20:30.630 --> 20:37.090
I can't die just by falling off a cliff.
I just felt sorry for Pa somehow.

20:38.470 --> 20:41.030
Natsume, your liver.

20:41.500 --> 20:44.700
Yuta, where are we going?

20:47.310 --> 20:48.570
Natsume!

20:51.580 --> 20:54.570
I'll follow you to
the end of the world.

20:55.750 --> 20:57.010
Natsume...

21:12.870 --> 21:14.330
I shall pray for her.

21:15.270 --> 21:19.600
Don't touch her.
I'm the one who will pray for her.

21:41.400 --> 21:49.910
Mukashi no koto datowa mada katazuke rarenai
It's just something in the past, but I still can't forget it

21:51.290 --> 21:59.790
ltsumade kakaruno to anata wa warau kedo
"How long does it take?" You smiled at me

22:01.250 --> 22:10.140
Dorekurai oboete iru hidoku naki nagara
How much do you remember? I cried hard

22:11.180 --> 22:20.690
Dorekurai oboete iru anokoto to ieba
How much do you remember if I talk about "that thing"?

22:25.820 --> 22:34.830
ltsumademo mada utsumuite
I still look down

22:35.790 --> 22:44.300
Tobikoe rarenai mizutamari
I can't jump over the puddle

22:45.420 --> 22:54.930
Wakaranakunaru moshikasuruto
I'm confused

22:55.270 --> 23:04.780
Kawarenai no wa watashi dake kana
Maybe I'm the only one who still can't change

23:09.700 --> 23:19.250
Mukashi no koto datowa mada katazuke rarenai
It's just something in the past, but I still can't forget it

23:23.930 --> 23:25.760
Ah, I'm full now.

23:26.730 --> 23:28.130
You ate them all by yourself.

23:28.440 --> 23:30.300
Hey, Yuta, look.

23:31.270 --> 23:32.030
Look at what?

23:32.540 --> 23:36.200
See, I'm eating so much that
I've grown, don't you think?

23:37.080 --> 23:38.870
No way you've grown...

23:41.380 --> 23:43.150
Don't stare at me like that.

23:43.380 --> 23:46.580
Oh, I see, you've grown horizontally.

23:48.190 --> 23:49.450
What?

23:49.660 --> 23:50.490
You've eaten too much.

23:51.290 --> 23:53.990
That's not true!
Boo!

23:55.130 --> 23:56.260
Nice face!

23:56.260 --> 23:58.860
Shut up!
Boo! Boo!

24:01.170 --> 24:03.360
Damn!
Boo!

24:07.810 --> 24:10.210
A boy named Nanao who
jumped out of a moving car...

24:10.210 --> 24:11.850
being driven by a strange man.

24:11.850 --> 24:14.380
His wounds were healed
by the medicine...

24:14.380 --> 24:17.480
that his mother had given him.
Is that medicine?

24:18.350 --> 24:20.350
When I followed the man
who had driven the car a woman with...

24:20.350 --> 24:23.260
a scar on her face confronted me
with a knife in her hand.

24:23.260 --> 24:27.920
Who are you? Does that scar have
something to do with a mermaid?

24:29.560 --> 24:30.990
Next, Episode 8
"The Last Face, Part I".

24:30.990 --> 24:33.800
Episode 8
The Last Face
(Part I)
Next, Episode 8
"The Last Face, Part I".

24:33.800 --> 24:34.940
Episode 8
The Last Face
(Part I)
